<?xml version='1.0' encoding='UTF-8'?><?xml-stylesheet href="http://www.blogger.com/styles/atom.css" type="text/css"?><feed xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom' xmlns:openSearch='http://a9.com/-/spec/opensearchrss/1.0/' xmlns:gd="http://schemas.google.com/g/2005"><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post211602016012876623..comments</id><updated>2017-04-13T04:47:21.148-06:00</updated><title type='text'>Comments on Pro Libertate: Cheney&#39;s Revenge: Coming to a Police Station Near You (UPDATED, 6/10)</title><link rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#feed' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/feeds/comments/default'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/211602016012876623/comments/default'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2009/06/cheneys-revenge-coming-to-police.html'/><link rel="hub" href="http://pubsubhubbub.appspot.com/"/><author><name>William N. Grigg</name><uri>http://www.blogger.com/profile/14368220509514750246</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='32' height='19' src='http://3.bp.blogspot.com/-5rhFUXs_62I/VgVL2E3rMII/AAAAAAAAMJ4/cjJOyI7W208/s220/Photo%2BRon%2BPaul%2BLiberty%2BReport.jpg'/></author><generator version='7.00' uri='http://www.blogger.com'>Blogger</generator><openSearch:totalResults>18</openSearch:totalResults><openSearch:startIndex>1</openSearch:startIndex><openSearch:itemsPerPage>25</openSearch:itemsPerPage><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-181523355459421739</id><published>2012-03-19T07:32:55.708-06:00</published><updated>2012-03-19T07:32:55.708-06:00</updated><title type='text'>http://blog.simplejustice.us/2012/03/17/no-you-can...</title><content type='html'>http://blog.simplejustice.us/2012/03/17/no-you-cant-taze-compliance.aspx  &lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;The Appellate Division has reversed the order denying suppression and ordered a new trial in a 4-1 opinion, and it hoses the county court. The Court of Appeals, the highest NY court, is not likely to grant permission to appeal notwithstanding the dissent.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;A nice day.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/211602016012876623/comments/default/181523355459421739'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/211602016012876623/comments/default/181523355459421739'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2009/06/cheneys-revenge-coming-to-police.html?showComment=1332163975708#c181523355459421739' title=''/><author><name>Anonymous</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2009/06/cheneys-revenge-coming-to-police.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-211602016012876623' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/211602016012876623' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-1560146498"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="March 19, 2012 at 7:32 AM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-7235477938781304820</id><published>2009-06-12T16:02:05.720-06:00</published><updated>2009-06-12T16:02:05.720-06:00</updated><title type='text'>&amp;quot;They&amp;#39;re gunning for the JBS methinks. It...</title><content type='html'>&lt;i&gt;&amp;quot;They&amp;#39;re gunning for the JBS methinks. It&amp;#39;s what makes sense is all...&amp;quot;&lt;/i&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;If you&amp;#39;re referring to the impending &lt;i&gt;Times&lt;/i&gt; article, I really don&amp;#39;t think that&amp;#39;s the case. &lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;The JBS is full of wonderful people, but its upper management is hopelessly inept: They have an unfailing gift for making the least of opportunities and an unfailing ability to duck important fights. &lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Why bother to go &amp;quot;gunning&amp;quot; if your quarry is so undistinguished?</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/211602016012876623/comments/default/7235477938781304820'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/211602016012876623/comments/default/7235477938781304820'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2009/06/cheneys-revenge-coming-to-police.html?showComment=1244844125720#c7235477938781304820' title=''/><author><name>William N. Grigg</name><uri>http://www.blogger.com/profile/14368220509514750246</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='22' height='32' src='http://2.bp.blogspot.com/_KgBT8kIRgBo/SJvC4fevJoI/AAAAAAAADAY/kAbZoDrn1qI/s1600-R/Grigg(2).jpg'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2009/06/cheneys-revenge-coming-to-police.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-211602016012876623' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/211602016012876623' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-1344012943"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="June 12, 2009 at 4:02 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-1210779370187029377</id><published>2009-06-12T14:53:48.864-06:00</published><updated>2009-06-12T14:53:48.864-06:00</updated><title type='text'>They&amp;#39;re gunning for the JBS methinks. It&amp;#39;s...</title><content type='html'>They&amp;#39;re gunning for the JBS methinks. It&amp;#39;s what makes sense is all...</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/211602016012876623/comments/default/1210779370187029377'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/211602016012876623/comments/default/1210779370187029377'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2009/06/cheneys-revenge-coming-to-police.html?showComment=1244840028864#c1210779370187029377' title=''/><author><name>Anonymous</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2009/06/cheneys-revenge-coming-to-police.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-211602016012876623' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/211602016012876623' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-1606163398"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="June 12, 2009 at 2:53 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-3919667885236563312</id><published>2009-06-10T20:49:43.051-06:00</published><updated>2009-06-10T20:49:43.051-06:00</updated><title type='text'>Michael, I&amp;#39;m confident that your meaning was q...</title><content type='html'>Michael, I&amp;#39;m confident that your meaning was quite clear -- but I do appreciate the decency you display in making sure that you&amp;#39;re understood.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/211602016012876623/comments/default/3919667885236563312'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/211602016012876623/comments/default/3919667885236563312'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2009/06/cheneys-revenge-coming-to-police.html?showComment=1244688583051#c3919667885236563312' title=''/><author><name>William N. Grigg</name><uri>http://www.blogger.com/profile/14368220509514750246</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='22' height='32' src='http://2.bp.blogspot.com/_KgBT8kIRgBo/SJvC4fevJoI/AAAAAAAADAY/kAbZoDrn1qI/s1600-R/Grigg(2).jpg'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2009/06/cheneys-revenge-coming-to-police.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-211602016012876623' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/211602016012876623' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-1344012943"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="June 10, 2009 at 8:49 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-4632329451081827989</id><published>2009-06-10T17:03:38.798-06:00</published><updated>2009-06-10T17:03:38.798-06:00</updated><title type='text'>I should modify my prior comment to state that I a...</title><content type='html'>I should modify my prior comment to state that I am disgusted with comments that automatically grant approval to the actions of the police.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;I am in no way degrading the responses of those who were communicating their condolences to the Cardall family.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/211602016012876623/comments/default/4632329451081827989'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/211602016012876623/comments/default/4632329451081827989'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2009/06/cheneys-revenge-coming-to-police.html?showComment=1244675018798#c4632329451081827989' title=''/><author><name>Michael</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2009/06/cheneys-revenge-coming-to-police.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-211602016012876623' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/211602016012876623' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-77004759"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="June 10, 2009 at 5:03 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-7576550223203976084</id><published>2009-06-10T11:32:08.203-06:00</published><updated>2009-06-10T11:32:08.203-06:00</updated><title type='text'>MoT-&#xa;&#xa;I could not agree with you more.  Frankly, I...</title><content type='html'>MoT-&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;I could not agree with you more.  Frankly, I am disgusted with the comments on the KSL comment board related to the link I posted earlier.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Too often here in Utah, deference is given to the police to the point where anything they do is right, no matter what the issue.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Here, an apparently mentally ill man is tasered?  Outrageous - and a very good indicator of where we are headed.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/211602016012876623/comments/default/7576550223203976084'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/211602016012876623/comments/default/7576550223203976084'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2009/06/cheneys-revenge-coming-to-police.html?showComment=1244655128203#c7576550223203976084' title=''/><author><name>Michael</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2009/06/cheneys-revenge-coming-to-police.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-211602016012876623' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/211602016012876623' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-1091870524"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="June 10, 2009 at 11:32 AM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-5373108004225402465</id><published>2009-06-10T10:53:18.402-06:00</published><updated>2009-06-10T10:53:18.402-06:00</updated><title type='text'>William,&#xa;&#xa;I have often said that we&amp;#39;re about 5...</title><content type='html'>William,&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;I have often said that we&amp;#39;re about 5 years behind the UK in terms of repression.  I think that your 6-8 month timeframe may be a lot closer to where we are right now.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/211602016012876623/comments/default/5373108004225402465'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/211602016012876623/comments/default/5373108004225402465'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2009/06/cheneys-revenge-coming-to-police.html?showComment=1244652798402#c5373108004225402465' title=''/><author><name>Anonymous</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2009/06/cheneys-revenge-coming-to-police.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-211602016012876623' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/211602016012876623' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-526786252"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="June 10, 2009 at 10:53 AM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-6384603338597882091</id><published>2009-06-10T06:45:50.476-06:00</published><updated>2009-06-10T06:45:50.476-06:00</updated><title type='text'>Greetings,&#xa;&#xa;Listen about that guy who was pulled o...</title><content type='html'>Greetings,&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Listen about that guy who was pulled over for running a&lt;br /&gt;stop sign.  When the cop checked the man&amp;#39;s driver&amp;#39;s license,&lt;br /&gt;he said, &amp;quot;You&amp;#39;re wearing glasses on your ID and you&amp;#39;re not &lt;br /&gt;now.  I&amp;#39;m going to have to give you a ticket for that.&amp;quot;  The guy &lt;br /&gt;said, &amp;quot;Officer, I have *contacts*.&amp;quot;  The cop said, &amp;quot;Look, buddy, &lt;br /&gt;I don&amp;#39;t care *who* you know -- I&amp;#39;m giving you a ticket.&amp;quot;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;I got this from jokes2go&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;mongol Doc Ellis 124</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/211602016012876623/comments/default/6384603338597882091'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/211602016012876623/comments/default/6384603338597882091'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2009/06/cheneys-revenge-coming-to-police.html?showComment=1244637950476#c6384603338597882091' title=''/><author><name>Doc Ellis</name><uri>http://www.blogger.com/profile/08543939658083915285</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='30' height='32' src='http://bp3.blogger.com/_1kwNGyaGlXM/SJS8lW2chPI/AAAAAAAAACM/qg-P4Z07IBI/S220/Doc+166+x+177.JPG'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2009/06/cheneys-revenge-coming-to-police.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-211602016012876623' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/211602016012876623' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-1989478426"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="June 10, 2009 at 6:45 AM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-5940627030473086428</id><published>2009-06-10T06:11:52.270-06:00</published><updated>2009-06-10T06:11:52.270-06:00</updated><title type='text'>Michael, it&amp;#39;s another example of using a Taser...</title><content type='html'>Michael, it&amp;#39;s another example of using a Taser when its not necessary.  I mean, what the hell, does every cop now whip out the taser because it&amp;#39;s simply &amp;quot;easier&amp;quot;?  Why not just keep an eye on whomever until they calm down.  But thats not what they do because anything out of the ordinary is an inconvenience, like interrupting their donut run, so to get back to those jelly rolls they need to put the perp down quickly.  Then its back to &amp;quot;Job 1&amp;quot;...  Patrol the sheep.  When you read your links comments you want to retch at the typical &amp;quot;Whats a cop supposed to do..., Their life is in danger..., It&amp;#39;s tough being a cop!  Sheesh!</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/211602016012876623/comments/default/5940627030473086428'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/211602016012876623/comments/default/5940627030473086428'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2009/06/cheneys-revenge-coming-to-police.html?showComment=1244635912270#c5940627030473086428' title=''/><author><name>MoT</name><uri>http://www.blogger.com/profile/13996714804361467430</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='32' height='23' src='http://bp3.blogger.com/_RPImowXMSuQ/SBjAjbSgPQI/AAAAAAAAABA/THgfv851ckU/S220/amsoc.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2009/06/cheneys-revenge-coming-to-police.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-211602016012876623' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/211602016012876623' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-388975791"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="June 10, 2009 at 6:11 AM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-1811425615897266124</id><published>2009-06-09T19:53:40.246-06:00</published><updated>2009-06-09T19:53:40.246-06:00</updated><title type='text'>You might find this interesting. This happened in ...</title><content type='html'>You might find this interesting. This happened in the UK, but we seem to be catching up very quickly.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;UK cop accuses colleagues of waterboarding suspects over pot http://rawstory.com/08/news/2009/06/09/london-police-waterboarding-pot/&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;London&amp;#39;s Metropolitan Police accused of waterboarding suspects&lt;br /&gt;http://www.timesonline.co.uk/tol/news/uk/crime/article6466430.ece&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;How cannabis case led to claims of theft and violence by police&lt;br /&gt;http://www.timesonline.co.uk/tol/news/uk/crime/article6466731.ece</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/211602016012876623/comments/default/1811425615897266124'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/211602016012876623/comments/default/1811425615897266124'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2009/06/cheneys-revenge-coming-to-police.html?showComment=1244598820246#c1811425615897266124' title=''/><author><name>Anonymous</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2009/06/cheneys-revenge-coming-to-police.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-211602016012876623' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/211602016012876623' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-502231806"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="June 9, 2009 at 7:53 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-5063905161340477324</id><published>2009-06-09T16:17:16.474-06:00</published><updated>2009-06-09T16:17:16.474-06:00</updated><title type='text'>Will - &#xa;&#xa;Speaking of tasing folks - see the follow...</title><content type='html'>Will - &lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Speaking of tasing folks - see the following story...&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;http://www.ksl.com/?nid=148&amp;amp;sid=6764721</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/211602016012876623/comments/default/5063905161340477324'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/211602016012876623/comments/default/5063905161340477324'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2009/06/cheneys-revenge-coming-to-police.html?showComment=1244585836474#c5063905161340477324' title=''/><author><name>Michael</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2009/06/cheneys-revenge-coming-to-police.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-2